      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Skills Development Fund Act 2004 [Act 640], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 44 the following section: “Approved skills training programme 44. The Corporation may identify and approve any skills training programme or other training programme accredited or recognized under the National Skills Development Act 2006 as an approved skills training programme for the purposes of a skills training loan or skills training financial assistance facility under this Act.” Amendment of section 45"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 45 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by substituting for the words “for approval of training programmes” the words “in relation to approved skills training programmes”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/34/eng@/~cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
