        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Corporation may— (a) prescribe such means test as the Corporation deems necessary and expedient in order to determine and select trainees who are eligible for the skills training loan or skills training financial assistance; and (b) require by written notice, the trainees or skills training provider, as the case may be, to provide additional documents and information within the period specified in such notice at any time after the application for skills training loan or skills training financial assistance has been approved but before the skills training loan or skills training financial assistance is disbursed.”. Amendment of section 52"
